  "sourceText": "Italian Spaghetti\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Monday, November 30, 2009 - 11:45pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 onion, chopped\n1 tablespoon butter\n1 kg mince\n1 teaspoon basil\n1 teaspoon oregano\n1/2 teaspoon thyme\n1 clv garlic\n400 grams spaghetti\n1 can tomato soup\nequal amount of water\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Fry the onion in butter, add mince, spices, garlic, tomato soup & water. Simmer 40 mins. Serve with spaghetti. Sprinkle with Parmesan.",
